    "body": "Sorry to revive this old PR, but is there anything that ever causes a \"slotchange\" event to be fired on `ShadowRoot`? In Chromium source I can't see it ever happening, and a quick search of wpt also doesn't find any tests around this.\r\n\r\nContext: https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/16733",
