    "updated_at": "2022-06-23T19:51:19Z",
    "body": "Yeah, that's a fair question. For my part I am pretty sure that I just followed @annevk's lead in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3487.\r\n\r\nMaybe it's because this is a common event to want to listen to on ShadowRoot? Or maybe we made a consistency error.",
