    "created_at": "2022-07-11T12:38:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-07-11T12:38:22Z",
    "body": "In a way `onslotchange` on `ShadowRoot` is an outlier now, but probably not worth trying to fix. Most events in `GlobalEventHandlers` can bubble up to `ShadowRoot`, with \"click\" and \"focus\" being plausible use cases. But putting all of those event handler attributes on `ShadowRoot` doesn't seem like a net improvement. And trying to remove `onslotchange` is not a good use of anyone's time.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
