    "created_at": "2022-07-22T07:33:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-07-22T07:33:37Z",
    "body": "I think it might be a net improvement to add most that can bubble there? Not sure why we'd treat it differently to other objects in that respect. Probably worth a new issue though.",
